{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1372402-sik-merchandise","id":1372402,"title":"Sik Merchandise","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-03T02:13:19-08:00","id":1372402,"title":"Sik Merchandise","content":"Hey friends!<br /> <br /> I'm getting maps for my house, because I have weird taste in decorations. I've been looking for an Exalted 3e wall map, it's the only non-real-world map I'm interested in putting up. Is there one around that's both pretty and detailed? I vaguely remember seeing one at some point, but maybe it was just a kickstarter exclusive thing. Is anything like that on the way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T02:37:34-08:00","id":1372408,"title":"","content":"I thought your title was &quot;<b>Silk</b> merchandise&quot; and I was ready to discuss bolts, dyes, and tailors <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> There's a gorgeous map that came with the collector's edition, I have it up on my wall. It's on a type of plasticky cloth. There are a lot of images of the map around, you could get one printed at any copy store if you can't find one for sale.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T04:16:05-08:00","id":1372423,"title":"","content":"Yeah, teach me to take on my housemate's sense of humour. I keep misreading it that way too.<br /> <br /> IIRC, that collector's edition map wasn't super detailed, right? Is this it? <a href=\"http://wiki.fig.cx/images/1/1b/Exalted_World_Map.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://wiki.fig.cx/images/1/1b/Exalted_World_Map.jpg</a><br /> It doesn't show Greyfalls or Mount Metagalapa. Are there bits missing from other parts of Creation I'm less familiar with? Tiraktou and Bent Creek are gone, too...<br /> <br /> Anyway, feel free to tell me about bolts, dyes and tailors as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T06:13:58-08:00","id":1372440,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/people/theonyxpath/works/34779237-exalted-map-of-creation?country_code=US&amp;finish=semi_gloss&amp;gclid=CjwKCAiAnfjyBRBxEiwA-EECLFP2eQD0U6-xIK1WU0QGVzVTjll5LyZsqqud4X96w77c93q7olFehxoC7IgQAvD_BwE&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds&amp;p=poster&amp;size=large&amp;utm_campaign=g.pla%20notset&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_source=google\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.redbubble.com/people/the..._source=google</a><br /> <br /> There's also a wall map of the Blessed Isle, but that seems to be have been Kickstarter only.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T05:02:44-08:00","id":1372673,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1120_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1120\" data-vbnamecard=\"1120\">Eric Minton</a> Thanks, that's the one I was thinking of. I'm glad it's available. Do you know if any further maps are planned? A lot of places aren't on this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-05T07:14:01-08:00","id":1372959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1372402-sik-merchandise?p=1372408#post1372408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought your title was &quot;<b>Silk</b> merchandise&quot; and I was ready to discuss bolts, dyes, and tailors <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Me too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1372402-sik-merchandise?p=1372408#post1372408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a gorgeous map that came with the collector's edition, I have it up on my wall. It's on a type of plasticky cloth. There are a lot of images of the map around, you could get one printed at any copy store if you can't find one for sale.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup, i also think getting a high-resolution version for either edition and printing on a bureau might be a easier way to go at it, as you can pick material, size of print and so on, adjusting to one's preferences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key"